#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-CG0460 expect=violation domain=AE
# Rule:Description: Raise an error when the High Level Term (--HLT) is not on the MedDRA primary system organ class hierarchy path.
#note "PLAN-function-surface-wave1 review round 1 (lane 2 L3): a MULTI-FINDING pin for a Check that reads only its binding ($x == false). Rows 1 and 3 are both off-path (Headaches NEC under Gastrointestinal disorders; Nausea and vomiting symptoms under Nervous system disorders) and must each fire — TWO findings, never one; row 2 is on-path and must stay quiet. It does NOT reach the M3 classifier arm (review round 2 L-3): the binding passes its columns POSITIONALLY (--HLT, --SOC), so the Sensitivity comes from the positional reading. The keyword-only classification (M3) is pinned in the engine by GroupedPredicatesTest.bindingOnlyCheckDerivesRecordSensitivityAndReportsEveryRow / operandPositionCheckDerivesRecordSensitivityAndReportsEveryRow and RuleClassifierTest.KeywordColumnOperands."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
#dictionaries dummy
#expectViolationCount 2
#expectViolationAt row=1
#expectViolationAt row=3
dataset AE label="Adverse Events"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col AESEQ type=Num label="Sequence Number"
col AEHLT type=Char label="High Level Term"
col AESOC type=Char label="Primary System Organ Class"
---
CDISCPILOT01 | AE | 01-701-1015 | 1 | Headaches NEC | Gastrointestinal disorders
CDISCPILOT01 | AE | 01-701-1015 | 2 | Headaches NEC | Nervous system disorders
CDISCPILOT01 | AE | 01-701-1015 | 3 | Nausea and vomiting symptoms | Nervous system disorders
---
